OL,3,GNEWSAFamed gorilla statue returns to
OL,4,AWakefield garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gorilla statue at the centre of a
OL,7,Fplanning row has been reunited with its
OL,8,FYorkshire owner, who joked the beloved
OL,9,Fanimal "didn't like" London.
OL,11,FThe gorilla, named Caesar, sat on top
OL,12,Fof a plinth on Adele Teale's house in
OL,13,FWakefield for two years, before the
OL,14,Fdistrict council ordered her to remove
OL,15,Fit on the grounds it did not have the
OL,16,Frequired planning permission.
OL,18,FWith Teale facing a fine, Caesar was
OL,19,Fpacked off to a travel agents in
OL,20,FMayfair in June this year, where his
OL,21,Fpresence amused customers for several
OL,22,Fweeks.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
