OL,3,GNEWSAFamed gorilla statue returns to
OL,4,AWakefield garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut with the gorilla seemingly
OL,7,Fhomesick, he was driven back to his
OL,8,Ftrue home in the Stanley area of
OL,9,FWakefield, where he is now standing in
OL,10,FTeale's garden as an ornament.
